      "proposedNextStart": "וּבְמוֹתָהּ",
      "finding": "The ה margin label is beside the row continuing the preceding sentence through בַבָּטֶן׃ and then printing וּבְמוֹתָהּ ... אֶחָד׃. The next זְכָר־בְּנִי clause occupies the following unnumbered row. Proposed split follows the first separator in the labelled row.",
      "limits": "Alternative next-row זְכָר־בְּנִי would require the marginal numeral to precede its first source word by a full physical row. The print does not give an inline numeral proving which separator it chooses.",
      "existingTemporaryUnit": {
        "verse": 4,
        "text": "זְכָר־בְּנִי כִּי סַכָּנוֹת רַבּוֹת רָאֲתָה בִּגְלָלְךָ בִּהְיוֹתְךָ בַבָּטֶן׃ וּבְמוֹתָהּ וּקְבַרְתָּהּ אֶצְלִי בְּקֶבֶר אֶחָד׃ זְכָר־בְּנִי אֶת־יְיָ אֱלֹהֵינוּ כָּל־יָמֶיךָ וְאַל־תֹּאבֶה לַחֲטֹא וְלַעֲבֹר מִצְוֹתָיו עֲשֵׂה צְדָקָה כָּל־יְמֵי חַיֶּיךָ וְאַל־תֵּלֵךְ בְּדַרְכֵי עַוְלָה׃",
